  "then_vs_now": null,
  "risks": [
    "The repo is public: every tracked file and the whole history are world-readable, so a sweep must precede each push.",
    "The pre-push sweep is a documented habit; the template secret-scan workflow runs on push and PR, after content is already public, and has no verified run.",
    "Pages load assets from public CDNs at view time; a CDN outage or change can break rendering.",
    "No build template is kept: the published file is the source of truth, so every change is a hand edit or a re-copy of that file.",
    "Template CI and security workflows have no verified run recorded.",
    "Pages liveness was checked on 2026-09-21 only; later state is not measured. No traffic or uptime figures exist."
  ],
